Part (c) We use the computational variance theorem [\(\operatorname{Cov}(X,Y) = \operatorname{E}(XY) - \operatorname{E}(X)\operatorname{E}(Y)\)]{.math .inline}, which also means [\(\operatorname{E}(XY) = \operatorname{Cov}(X,Y) + \operatorname{E}(X)\operatorname{E}(Y)\)]{.math .inline}.
